abstract: >-
  On-demand chemical hazard and safer-solvent screening for TURI / UMass Lowell:
  CAS lookup with identity, GHS/physchem, expert or automatic TURI hazard scores,
  and optional SDS or Hansen enrichment.
keywords:
  - toxics use reduction
  - chemical hazard
  - safer solvents
  - TURI
